{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026r4g1p7cvFO1793691414.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>摩根士丹利主席兼首席執行官皮克在國際金融領袖投資峰會上指，AI是互聯網出現以來，最偉大的技術進步，企業進行龐大的投資並非不合理。</p><p></p><p>摩根士丹利主席兼首席執行官皮克說：「試想7年、10年、12年，我們才進行到9局比賽的第2局。我們認為投入10萬億至15萬億美元，是一個非常大的區間，但這並非不合理的總額。若長期能產生效率，並最終達成長期效能，這些數字非同尋常，我認為它們會實現。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.437910+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.991778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:51.541556+00:00","content_hash":"ae88a7c3397c4055a46f615398ff82c93592e11feb38e544dc0a954cab4dd5f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.437910+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}